# Core Agent Discipline

## Law 0 — Preflight

Before editing: read relevant source of truth; confirm paths, contracts, and ownership.

## Law 4 — Postflight

Before claiming done: run verification; report evidence, docs touched, residual risks.

## Rules

- Code/config beats documentation when they conflict — report contradictions.
- Do not invent APIs, tables, or stack choices not in the repo.
- Delegate implementation to path owners.
- Tier 3 requires explicit human approval in task scope.
